# Task 2 – Python Problem-Solving Practice

## Overview

This task focuses on solving 20 Python programming problems using logical reasoning, structured problem-solving techniques, and reusable functions.

## File Included

- Task_2_Python_Problem_Solving_Q1-Q20.ipynb – Jupyter Notebook containing solutions to 20 Python problems, explanations, and test cases.

## Topics Covered

- Python functions
- Strings and lists
- Conditional statements and loops
- Dictionaries and sets
- Number-based problems
- List manipulation
